        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(the “Company”, “Hub”, “we”, “us” or “our”) is a leading supply chain solutions provider that offers comprehensive transportation and logistics management services focused on reliability, visibility and value for our customers.",
        "start_character": 41,
        "end_character": 268
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-026866",
